          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagezeyo basenya imidugudu yabo, umurima mwiza wose babonye, umuntu wese ajugunyamo ibuye bakawuzuza. Basiba amasōko y'amazi yose, batema ibiti byiza byose, hasigara i Kiri Hareseti honyine ari ho hagifite inkike z'amabuye, ariko abanyamihumetso baraza barahagota na ho, bahatera amabuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
