        {
          "text": "Maze umwami w'i Mowabu abonye ko urugamba rumugasiye, ajyana abagabo magana arindwi bitwaje inkota, kugira ngo babatwaze bagere ku mwami wa Edomu, ariko ntibabishobora. ",
          "type": "text",
